(112, 3, 509, 'Découvrez notre nouvelle collection \n\n🌟 Appareils Électroménagers de Qualité\nSimplifiez votre quotidien avec nos appareils électroménagers performants et fiables. De la cuisine au ménage, trouvez les meilleurs outils pour vous aider dans vos tâches quotidiennes. \n\n🔌 **Câbles et Chargeurs** 🔌\nRestez connecté avec nos câbles et chargeurs de haute qualité. Que ce soit pour votre téléphone, tablette ou autres appareils, nous avons les accessoires qu\'il vous faut pour ne jamais manquer d\'énergie. \n\nProfitez dès maintenant de nos offres spéciales et donnez un coup de fraîcheur à votre quotidien !\nContactez nous au +22956585707 ', 'dressur_pro_1720907440.jpg', '2024-07-31 22:45:09', '2024-08-07 22:45:09', 4, 1985, 'Gratuit', 2740, 1, '[2,3,799,658,782,108,722,250,4,82,642,663,124,800,29,63,801,53,802,397,713,803,804,805,806,807,808,809,128,10,810,811,39,812,813,766,814,268,815,817,818,819,820,821,822,823,522,436,824,825,826,753,720,827,828,829,830,831,832,737,833,834,835,836,837,838,839,420,166,840,748,841,842,477,843,844,845,846,847,848,849,850,851,852,854,855,856,857,858,859,860,11,455,861,862,863,864,865,792,866,867,868,869,870,33,871,872,873,874,875,876,122,877,593,878,879,880,882,883,884,885,886,887,888,889,890,46,891,17,637,239,892,893,894,895,896,897,898,899,900,220,901,902,903,904,905,906,907,908,910,413,911,275,912,913,914,915,916,917,918,919,920,921,922,923,924,925,926,927,928,929,930,931,932,933,934,935,936,937,938,939,940,941,942,775,943,228,944,945,946,581,947,948,321,949,950,951,952,953,954,437,955,956,957,958,959,960,961,962,597,431,963,964,965,966,967,968,969,750,779,366,971,972,562,234,489,973,484,974,498,242,976,977,978,979,980,359,22,687,785,546,983,984,985,472,986,987,132,734,989,990,728,991,699,672,7,992,790,426,993,608,780,994,21,379,277,187,995,996,997,998,999,1000,774,401,1001,791,87,1002,101,1003,1005,1006,1007,1008,1009,1010,184,461,1011,1012,684,1013,667,77,1014,1015,47,392,708,1017,719,241,139,730,1022,272,1023,304,798,