(148, 2, 869, 'Vous êtes en quête d\'une formation professionnelle, Pratique pour assurer votre indépendance ?\nInnov\'jeune a pensé à vous..\n\nUn atelier de 5 jours pour vous former dans les domaines suivants\n\n-Perlage accessoires \n-Customisation accessoires \n-make-up -onglerie\nDes ateliers animés par des professionnels compétents.\n\nDémarrage : 2 septembre au 6 septembre 2024\n\nInscription :2.000f \n\nFrais de formation : 20.000f\n\nNB : inscription gratuite pour tout inscrits avant 20 Août.\n\nInscrivez-vous au\nhttps://wa.me/qr/OAFFKH2PEZ4MN1', 'dressur_pro_1722548598.jpg', '2024-08-01 22:13:42', '2024-08-05 22:13:42', 4, 874, 'Gratuit', 1321, 1, '[910,831,866,932,923,2,877,937,953,908,742,887,868,897,3,963,782,890,964,965,108,966,967,968,899,922,969,947,895,750,860,840,779,825,904,861,720,366,220,748,839,956,859,10,11,810,971,830,803,841,945,33,806,972,562,855,917,924,931,581,234,489,766,973,807,846,484,936,928,820,974,498,4,858,242,976,977,978,979,980,359,981,22,962,886,687,889,785,46,722,822,814,876,949,925,775,546,805,906,948,880,983,984,938,985,907,472,986,987,988,63,132,815,893,894,734,835,989,990,842,728,826,991,818,699,672,7,992,790,426,993,812,593,608,436,817,420,929,903,955,780,737,994,21,951,379,277,187,995,912,823,996,997,998,819,999,637,1000,509,774,879,713,401,1001,250,791,958,477,87,658,321,1002,927,101,1003,944,1005,437,1006,961,1007,1008,1009,1010,184,935,461,1011,1012,684,865,1013,667,77,1014,82,1015,940,849,47,392,1016,708,1017,1018,719,241,29,642,139,730,1022,311,272,1023,304,122,228,1025,833,798,1026,596,124,1028,1029,469,681,738,163,808,616,1031,1032,1033,1034,196,1035,102,183,1036,203,838,1037,1038,875,137,336,740,141,281,691,1039,597,1040,515,1041,28,1042,275,896,554,402,952,564,705,751,111,289,413,655,1045,269,723,170,787]', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'produit_service', 0),
(149, 1, 890, 'Eagles Express est une société de livraison de premier plan, prête à répondre à tous vos besoins de livraison. Notre équipe dévouée propose une gamme complète de services, allant de la livraison de colis à celle de repas, des courses en pharmacie au supermarché, ainsi que la prise en charge de vos documents administratifs et du pressing. Avec notre disponibilité aux numéros 94152474 et 47367805, nous sommes là pour rendre vos livraisons rapides, efficaces et sans tracas. Faites confiance à Eagles Express pour une expérience de livraison fiable et de qualité.', 'dressur_pro_1722556431.jpg', '2024-08-06 08:57:23', '2024-08-08 08:57:23', 4, 601, 'Gratuit', 913, 1, '[803,1082,782,841,2,997,780,785,1088,860,889,1089,1070,498,11,948,139,4,10,581,977,892,82,77,1092,3,861,908,812,968,564,1097,859,133,220,722,1100,184,990,642,751,535,1104,1005,1107,1015,897,242,366,596,436,239,1112,1114,748,132,877,910,904,849,858,1077,1125,1034,1006,740,1032,252,832,893,801,737,1141,894,1143,1037,705,321,805,122,713,757,1014,547,87,1152,1155,1057,46,822,825,842,371,974,775,987,868,810,754,750,268,952,687,1168,949,14,515,124,1171,962,808,1174,461,896,887,1177,978,98,1179,681,865,994,29,181,76,171,359,226,229,477,429,406,517,481,402,522,269,250,790,272,47,125,304,292,857,586,929,281,1180,43,1182,86,1184,1185,738,196,430,773,774,831,792,663,819,992,830,864,1187,753,1001,672,413,923,806,840,1188,1190,161,444,972,1192,1193,719,1194,1026,798,549,820,511,1195,234,845,667,1200,833,39,1201,71,980,957,655,148,912,1017,838,471,839,1205,1207,1208,492,1071,807,835,1209,1211,1212,102,1213,191,1214,895,401,1218,169,186,12,991,141,1219,1022,1220,658,53,484,1221,1008,419,1222,1223,770,166,1224,826,940,767,866,420,723,1225,93,595,1228,1229,142]', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 'produit_service', 0),
