(383, 2, 2396, 'Trésors de la Terre : La Beauté Africaine sans Produits Chimiques* est un guide incontournable pour découvrir les secrets de beauté ancestraux africains. Offrant des astuces naturelles à base de plantes, huiles et rituels traditionnels, ce livre propose des solutions simples et efficaces pour sublimer la peau mélanée. Un véritable trésor pour adopter une routine beauté saine, sans produits chimiques, tout en respectant les spécificités de la peau noire.\r\nNous sommes actuellement en promotion alors vous pouvez le prendre à seulement 999f au lieu de 1999f. +229 53500225 disponible pour vous répondre sur WhatsApp. ', 'dressur_pro_1726490385.png', '2024-09-16 13:51:14', '2024-09-24 13:51:14', 4, 3665, 'Gratuit', 4290, 1, '[1844,2370,2325,436,2339,2298,2183,2296,132,2318,1222,2237,3,2146,2408,2168,587,2287,2158,163,1870,2365,2409,1114,2400,94,2410,1901,2004,186,2271,1883,2290,974,1930,2312,2283,2412,1545,1712,4,841,2239,2269,2273,304,720,2248,1441,1308,1926,11,904,2414,2279,384,2373,2180,2169,1716,1483,2415,2181,2227,2374,461,242,2416,1608,46,1514,1750,2231,910,2006,2143,887,2417,2148,2188,2407,2105,2207,1174,825,2053,1938,2398,2291,2402,1542,1850,681,2418,2363,810,2419,2360,2164,471,2375,2102,1411,2088,1965,2098,1852,2420,1194,329,2203,2101,2089,1500,2041,1342,1032,731,2141,1772,877,2293,838,2329,2206,890,2421,1219,1273,2166,642,805,2114,2134,2399,2352,949,2422,2171,2253,2386,2260,1193,419,47,2292,1565,1112,2201,1826,125,1572,1595,2303,2366,2423,1088,10,549,2157,2425,1829,1300,1481,1493,2426,2427,1241,2381,169,1799,2289,1773,1944,1628,1878,1599,798,515,2163,2429,2371,484,1691,2224,1450,2431,2061,858,1857,1466,2109,228,455,785,2074,353,1575,2432,1458,2216,1589,2199,2159,82,2390,2,2300,822,2433,1873,2058,953,2434,227,2367,1763,199,1815,984,2435,526,2343,184,366,2436,269,775,765,98,2437,866,77,2028,1877,12,889,1895,2357,748,2438,268,1999,1818,1537,2439,1185,2232,1017,2440,2441,1782,2029,1947,1687,2442,1558,1009,2229,2443,1505,2444,2160,1075,831,52,2445,17