(954, 1, 3168, '\n\n\n\n\n🎧 Casque P9 – Plongez dans un Son Exceptionnel ! 🎶\n\n🔊 Basses puissantes & son immersif – Profitez d’une qualité audio incroyable pour écouter votre musique comme jamais auparavant.\n\n💡 Confort absolu – Conçu avec des coussinets doux et un arceau ajustable pour un port longue durée sans gêne.\n\n🔋 Autonomie longue durée – Écoutez sans interruption grâce à une batterie performante qui vous accompagne toute la journée.\n\n📲 Connexion rapide & facile – Compatible avec tous vos appareils grâce à la technologie sans fil avancée.\n\n🎨 Un style qui vous ressemble – Disponible en plusieurs couleurs élégantes pour s’adapter à votre look.\n\n🔥 Offre limitée ! Commandez maintenant et profitez d’un prix spécial !\n\n📩 Contactez-nous en message privé pour commander \n\n', 'dressur_pro_1740426270.jpg', '2025-02-25 05:29:55', '2025-03-03 05:29:55', 4, 7423, 'Gratuit', 8098, 1, '[3,4380,4612,3272,4408,4498,4601,4484,4452,4508,3831,4597,4553,4606,4501,4613,4510,4483,4495,4440,4497,4614,4592,4535,4184,4032,4583,2018,53,4615,751,4616,4617,4618,4619,2,1401,4620,4621,4622,3167,4623,4584,4624,4625,4626,4627,3699,4628,4629,4630,4631,4544,3580,4632,4503,4633,4301,4129,4634,4444,4635,4636,4637,4526,4638,4639,4640,4641,4642,4381,1545,4643,4644,4645,4646,4647,4536,4648,3389,4329,4603,4649,4650,4580,4401,4473,3375,4525,4651,4652,4653,4654,4655,4487,3649,4577,4656,4657,4518,4570,4658,4506,4659,2908,2358,163,4529,2607,4660,4661,4410,4662,3021,4519,4582,4551,4663,4664,4533,4665,4666,383,3851,4667,471,4668,4576,4669,4546,957,1589,4670,4671,4672,4489,1961,4673,4674,4131,4451,4675,4676,3525,4677,4678,4075,4679,2203,4680,3199,4571,4569,4681,4682,3635,4683,4684,3886,4685,3071,4686,2284,4687,4688,4689,4690,4538,4691,3361,2864,4692,4693,4694,4405,4474,4695,4461,3594,4696,4697,4698,4261,4578,4407,4699,4377,4435,4700,4701,4702,4703,1441,4704,4705,4706,4707,4455,3776,3996,4400,4422,2512,3945,4708,4709,4186,4710,4711,4712,1833,2053,4713,4714,4715,1514,4716,4717,132,4534,3981,4718