(1203, 2, 5062, 'Films et séries gratuits, en ligne et hors ligne !\n\nPourquoi payer quand vous pouvez tout avoir gratuitement ? Avec [Nom de l’application], accédez à un catalogue illimité de films et séries, sans abonnement, sans carte bancaire, et même sans connexion !\n\n✅ Un large choix : blockbusters, séries cultes, nouveautés…\n✅ Qualité HD : une expérience fluide et immersive.\n✅ Mode hors ligne : téléchargez vos contenus et regardez-les sans internet.\n✅ Zéro inscription : téléchargez, regardez, profitez !\n\nLe cinéma dans votre poche, gratuitement.\n\nÉcrivez-nous en inbox pour recevoir l’application et commencer à streamer !\n\n', 'dressur_pro_1744175594.jpg', '2025-04-09 07:53:51', '2025-04-21 07:53:51', 4, 2026, 'Gratuit', 2347, 1, '[5681,5682,2886,5679,5246,3698,5676,4960,5678,4435,4406,4206,5586,1574,5653,5683,4054,4363,4991,3,4896,4832,2053,5413,3831,5664,5119,2180,5644,129,4031,5488,5301,2941,5012,5641,5650,419,3773,5111,1411,5142,5175,4546,5137,5473,4227,1938,82,70,2181,2415,2895,5306,5662,5624,3376,4535,46,3651,3383,534,1565,2789,3436,3696,4691,4853,802,411,3034,5684,5685,5348,3389,5043,3391,461,904,4715,5126,2599,199,3775,30,4079,5107,5606,2005,2296,1870,2944,4674,5566,5649,5133,5628,5512,5686,5164,5114,4261,4199,3155,4584,5601,87,5663,4077,3359,4572,3635,5466,5396,3674,5271,2803,5068,5407,3632,5471,124,3843,5106,3524,5500,5661,4573,2637,4719,4329,4654,308,102,4433,477,4966,3508,5083,5100,1441,5463,3580,2658,4405,5677,2029,5105,5538,4397,2358,5509,5609,5088,5052,3996,5547,5002,908,748,5098,5531,798,4314,4,3028,5651,4209,4571,1505,4484,5537,5689,4551,3454,596,4889,3234,5328,3776,4467,2386,5283,4218,4994,5584,5602,4632,2037,4776,4522,5331,4630,3146,3938,4906,1545,498,5620,3608,5691,4679,718,5491,3888,4965,4241,5402,3088,5192,93,2230,5692,5693,2559,4441,5123,5659,5055,4582,5694,542,5621,139,1514,1212,5184,2325,832,3972,4616,5550,4825,3959,2,1107,4526,4823,1308,1112,4882,5003,5459,5212,4282,4129,4353,2015,2554,5545,3932,3731,3586,5695,609,187,2607,