(1265, 1, 5872, '_*ARTHROTIIM*_ \n\n```Ariyo pharma``` , nous disposons d\'un _*traitement efficace contre la maladie d\'arthrose*_.\n\n Le produit _*Arthrotiim*_ fait disparaître les douleurs articulaires au niveau du genoux, de la hanche, de la colonne vertébrale et des épaules. Grâce à sa formule unique à base de plantes, il facilite la reconstitution du Cartilage au niveau des articulations pour vous permettre d\'avoir des mouvements plus faciles et vous pouvez désormais marcher sans béquille. Arthrotiim est disponible au cabinet ```ARIYO PHARMA``` à Cotonou et vous pouvez l\'avoir dans toutes les communes du Bénin.\n\n _Contactez nous directement ou par WhatsApp._ \n\n *```A ARIYO PHARMA, c\'est le naturel au profit de la santé.```\n\n _☎️ *0167848709', 'dressur_pro_1746857276.jpg', '2025-05-11 07:42:20', '2025-05-17 07:42:20', 4, 1927, 'Gratuit', 2266, 1, '[6119,3,5861,6088,6130,5078,6057,6012,199,6129,5720,6039,5932,2607,5246,6115,5937,6053,5984,4931,5960,1112,2053,4356,5233,5967,5826,5662,6048,6022,6127,46,4,3831,2,6098,281,5948,6061,5244,6134,6135,5983,5381,5119,5833,2497,5864,6073,3408,3776,5175,4832,3972,5859,2203,5884,6070,6137,5974,5542,5944,6014,1505,3718,3146,5976,4409,4991,4327,6138,5894,5769,5875,1879,5407,5358,6102,5876,5848,6139,6132,4571,6054,3028,6084,5696,6074,620,1514,5844,5834,275,6047,4674,2320,6140,6133,4942,5962,5959,5748,6118,5868,5843,5831,6063,5396,5981,6123,6141,5163,82,5972,6142,6011,4032,802,5905,5926,5979,6008,3452,6023,2944,5754,4701,5413,5830,3208,5726,1565,5820,6143,5854,904,5942,6043,5753,5728,6083,445,6122,6144,5952,5950,6145,4314,5804,6080,4582,5776,5961,6146,365,4206,4359,6147,5658,5402,5771,6148,5842,5107,3061,2183,6101,6064,5867,5957,6055,6149,4394,6150,3696,5271,477,6152,3410,6153,6154,6155,5404,6156,5306,718,6087,3127,5785,748,5779,5636,4165,5919,5590,4823,2325,4687,4968,5890,3321,1572,5494,6157,3508,2018,5767,4882,798,6158,3580,4526,5847,3773,5002,2296,6056,6159,3109,6160,6027,5789,5734,5736,4731,866,498,3614,5954,5512,2